{"status":"completed","summary":"Inventory application is running on node2 and node3 at port 8080. Node1 load-balances HTTP traffic on port 80 across both backends. Configuration and data persisted through sequential restarts of all three nodes.","actions_performed":["Installed and enabled nginx on all nodes.","Configured node2 and node3 with node-specific inventory application responses on TCP/8080.","Configured node1 with both backends and round-robin balancing on TCP/80.","Updated persistent firewalld rules and enabled SELinux proxy connectivity.","Verified direct backend health, cross-node frontend access, alternating backend selection, and inventory content.","Restarted node2, node3, and node1 individually and verified changed boot identities and recovery after each restart."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Inventory application on node2:8080","command_ids":["cmd-aa51068f7c944a54","cmd-a840cad9748846c7"],"summary":"node2 listens on 0.0.0.0:8080 and returns HTTP 200, `X-Backend: node2`, and Inventory Web Application content before and after restart."},{"requirement":"Inventory application on node3:8080","command_ids":["cmd-b51903f299994dc0","cmd-3b1defdd0edc4adb"],"summary":"node3 listens on 0.0.0.0:8080 and returns HTTP 200, `X-Backend: node3`, and Inventory Web Application content before and after restart."},{"requirement":"Load balancer on node1:80 distributes across both backends","command_ids":["cmd-7df33b6cc9d94be9","cmd-b4daa52c73f34782"],"summary":"Configuration lists both backend addresses, and a cross-node client observes alternating node2/node3 HTTP 200 responses through node1 with `X-Load-Balancer: node1`."},{"requirement":"node2 mandatory restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-fe4ed3b72ad64b91","cmd-fbcee6c48c114abb","cmd-a840cad9748846c7","cmd-6e7831a93c714734"],"summary":"Healthy baseline boot ID 83a0a80f-773c-4f3e-9137-1e7aa887b07a, acknowledged native reboot, changed boot ID c468eed3-4683-4dc8-8201-3f130b0019f2, recovered nginx/content, and restored two-backend distribution."},{"requirement":"node3 mandatory restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-c1e33b88780b4160","cmd-fb399c3a946042d8","cmd-3b1defdd0edc4adb","cmd-980618a1bf12403f"],"summary":"Healthy baseline boot ID 96974ac3-f19e-45f7-9672-e880dd505cf8, acknowledged native reboot, changed boot ID b59ecf83-fd81-404e-a189-f01973d08de9, recovered nginx/content, and restored two-backend distribution."},{"requirement":"node1 mandatory restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-e45d909d8b7e48df","cmd-b9992bb23d9b430c","cmd-a5c6eaea45ce4303","cmd-b4daa52c73f34782"],"summary":"Healthy baseline boot ID 0581c914-b77e-45ce-b511-c0c9f578a303, acknowledged native reboot, changed boot ID ccb84533-1c3f-4c61-a070-584ee8e56fef, recovered port 80 listener, and externally verified balanced inventory responses."}]}
